cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this workflow, please cite it using these metadata, and cite the
  data providers listed in docs/DATA_SOURCES.md.
type: software
title: "TNBC Target Discovery: A Reproducible Multi-Resource Workflow"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible triple-negative breast cancer target-nomination workflow
  using open-access TCGA-BRCA data from the NCI Genomic Data Commons, DepMap
  CRISPR screens, and local Gene Ontology and MSigDB collections. It records
  frozen-input provenance, an audit of an earlier exploratory workflow with
  test-enforced remediation, and retained limiting findings.
authors:
